<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">

<head>
    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 100px 25px 180px;

            @bottom-center {
                content: element(pageFooter);
            }

            @top-right {
                content: element(pageHeader);
            }
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: right;
            margin-right: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        h3 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .annexABC-table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            margin: auto;
            table-layout: auto;
        }

        .first-col {
            width: 4%;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid black;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

        .second-col {
            width: 15%;
            padding: 5px;
            border: 1px solid black;
            text-align: left;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

        .parent_loan_col {
            width: 20%;
            padding: 5px;
            border: 1px solid black;
            text-align: left;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

        .top_up_col, .insurance_col, .total_col{
            width: 20%;
            padding: 5px;
            border: 1px solid black;
            text-align: left;
            word-wrap: break-word;
        }

        .half_col {
            width: 50%;
            padding: 5px;
        }
        .page-break {
            page-break-before: always;
        }

        #pageFooter {
            position: running(pageFooter);
            text-align: center;
            padding-bottom: 100px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        #pageFooter table {
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
        }

        #pageHeader {
            position: running(pageHeader);
            text-align: right;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<header id="pageHeader"> <img src="https://cdn.pchf.in/logos/piramal_company_logo.png" height="150px"
                              width="auto" />
</header>
<h1>Annex A</h1>
<h2>Key Facts and Statements</h2>
<h3>Part 1 (Interest rate and fees/charges)</h3>
<table class="annexABC-table">
    <tr style="font-weight: bold;">
        <td class="half_col" style="text-align: left;" >
            Generated Date: <span th:text="${generatedDate}"></span>
        </td>
        <td class="half_col" style="text-align: right;">
            Validity: 3 Days
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<br />
<table class="annexABC-table">
    <tr style="text-align:left; padding-left:5px; font-weight: bold;">
        <th class="first-col">Sr No.</th>
        <th class="second-col">Particulars</th>
        <th class="parent_loan_col">Details</th>
        <th class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}">Top Up Details</th>
        <th class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}">Insurance Details</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">1</td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Loan Proposal/Account No.</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${loanAccountNo}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_leadId}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_leadId}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Type of Loan</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col">Housing Loan</td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}">Top Up Loan</td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}">Insurance Loan</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">2</td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Sanctioned Loan Amount (in
            Rupees)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col">₹ <span th:text="${loanAmount}"></span></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_amount}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_amount}">
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">3</td>
        <td class="second-col">
            <b>Disbursal Schedule</b> <br />
            (i) Disbursement in stages or 100% upfront.<br />
            (ii) Disbursement in stages, specify stages and amount at each stage.
        </td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${disbursal100orNot}">
        </td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${disbursal100orNot}">
        </td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${disbursal100orNot}">
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">4</td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Loan term (year/months/days)
        </td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col"><span th:text="${loanTerm}"></span></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_tenor}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_tenor}">
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr th:if="${tenureSplitList != null}" th:each="tenure, iterStat : ${tenureSplitList}">
        <td class="first-col" th:if="${tenureSplitList != null}"></td>
        <td class="second-col" th:if="${tenureSplitList != null}"><span th:text="${iterStat.index + 1} + ' Period'"></span></td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:if="${tenureSplitList != null}"><span th:text="${tenure}"></span></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable and tenureSplitList != null}" th:text="${tenure}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable and tenureSplitList != null}" th:text="${tenure}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">5</td>
        <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold;">Instalment details</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Type of Instalments</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${instalmentType}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${instalmentType}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${instalmentType}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Number of EMIs</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${loanTerm}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_tenor}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_tenor}">
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col"> EMI(in Rupees)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:if="${tenureSplitList == null}">₹ <span th:text="${emi}"></span></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable and tenureSplitList == null}" th:text="${top_up_emi}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable and tenureSplitList == null}" th:text="${insurance_emi}"></td>

        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:if="${tenureSplitList != null}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable and tenureSplitList != null}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable and tenureSplitList != null}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr th:if="${tenureSplitList != null}" th:each="tenure, iterStat : ${tenureSplitList}">
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col"><span style="padding: 2px"
                                     th:text="${iterStat.index == 0 ? 'First ' + tenure + ' months'
                                                        : (iterStat.index == tenureSplitList.size() - 1
                                                            ? 'Remaining ' + tenure + ' months'
                                                            : 'Next ' + tenure + ' months')}"></span></td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:if="${primaryEmiSplitList != null and !#lists.isEmpty(primaryEmiSplitList)}">₹ <span th:text="${primaryEmiSplitList[iterStat.index]}"></span></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable and topUpLoanEmiSplit != null and !#lists.isEmpty(topUpLoanEmiSplit)}" th:text="${topUpLoanEmiSplit[iterStat.index]}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable and insuranceEmiSplit != null and !#lists.isEmpty(insuranceEmiSplit)}" th:text="${insuranceEmiSplit[iterStat.index]}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Commencement of repayment, post sanction</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col">5th of every month</td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}">5th of every month</td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}">5th of every month</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">6</td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Interest rate (%)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col"><span th:text="${roi}"></span>% p.a</td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"><span th:text="${top_up_roi}"></span>% p.a</td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"><span th:text="${insurance_roi}"></span>% p.a</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Interest Type (Fixed/Floating)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${interestRateType}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${interestRateType}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${interestRateType}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">7</td>
        <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold;">Additional Information in case
            of Floating rate of interest</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Reference Benchmark</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${referenceBenchmark}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${referenceBenchmark}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${referenceBenchmark}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Benchmark rate (%) (B)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${benchmarkRate}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${benchmarkRate}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${benchmarkRate}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Spread (%) (S)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${spreadRate}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${spreadRate}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${spreadRate}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Final rate (%)
            R = (B) + (S)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${finalRate}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${finalRate}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${finalRate}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Reset periodicity
            (Months)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${resetPeriodicity}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${resetPeriodicity}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${resetPeriodicity}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Impact of change in the reference benchmark <br />
            (for 25 bps)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${benchmarkImpact}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${benchmarkImpact}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${benchmarkImpact}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Change in EMI(in Rupees)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${benchmarkEmi}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_benchmarkEmi}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_benchmarkEmi}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col">Change in No. of EMIs</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${benchmarkTenure}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_benchmarkTenure}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_benchmarkTenure}"></td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">8</td>
        <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold;">Fee/Charges</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">1. Payable to PFL (A)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${payableToREA}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(i)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Login Fee (One-time)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${loginFees}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(ii)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Admin Charges (One-time)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${adminFees}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(iii)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Processing Fees (One-time)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col">₹ <span th:text="${processingFees}"></span></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(iv)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Stamp Duty Charges</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${stampDutyChargesForKfs}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}">
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(v)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Stamp Duty Service Charges</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${stampDutyServiceCharge}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}">
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col"></td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">2. Payable to a third party through PFL (B)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${payableToREBDisplay}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(i)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Valuation Fees (One-time)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${valuationFees}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(ii)</td>
        <td class="second-col">CERSAI Charges (One-time)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${cersaiCharges}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(iii)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Insurance Charges (One-time)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${insuranceCharges}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(iv)</td>
        <td class="second-col">MG Fees</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${mgFees}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(v)</td>
        <td class="second-col">CIBIL Charges</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${cibilCharges}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">9</td>
        <td class="second-col" style="font-weight: bold;">Annual Percentage Rate (APR)
            (%)</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" th:text="${apr}"></td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" th:text="${top_up_apr}"></td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" th:text="${insurance_apr}"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">10</td>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;">Details of Contingent Charges
            (in Rupees or %, as applicable)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(i)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Penal Charges, if any, in case of delayed payment
        </td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" style="text-align: justify;">
            24% per annum i.e. 2% p.m. on default of Installment/ EMI from the date of default till the date of
            actual payment
        </td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" style="text-align: justify;">
            24% per annum i.e. 2% p.m. on default of Installment/ EMI from the date of default till the date of
            actual payment
        </td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" style="text-align: justify;">
            24% per annum i.e. 2% p.m. on default of Installment/ EMI from the date of default till the date of
            actual payment
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(ii)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Other Penal Charges, if any</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" style="text-align: justify;">
            2% p.m. on Outstanding Amount for the non-compliance of the terms and conditions of the Transaction
            Documents as detailed below by the Borrower, for the period beginning the date of such non-compliance
            until the same is cured to the satisfaction of the Lender
        </td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" style="text-align: justify;">
            2% p.m. on Outstanding Amount for the non-compliance of the terms and conditions of the Transaction
            Documents as detailed below by the Borrower, for the period beginning the date of such non-compliance
            until the same is cured to the satisfaction of the Lender
        </td>
        <td class="insurance_col" th:if="${insurance_child_loan_applicable}" style="text-align: justify;">
            2% p.m. on Outstanding Amount for the non-compliance of the terms and conditions of the Transaction
            Documents as detailed below by the Borrower, for the period beginning the date of such non-compliance
            until the same is cured to the satisfaction of the Lender
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="first-col">(iii)</td>
        <td class="second-col">Part Payment/Pre-closure charges</td>
        <td class="parent_loan_col" style="text-align: justify;">
            <ul th:if="${isMortgageForeclosureChangesApplicable}!=true">
                <li style="text-align: left;">Fixed rate HL: 2% of principal of loan being prepaid + applicable taxes</li>
                <li style="text-align: left;">NHL for business purpose (individual): 4% of principal of loan being prepaid + applicable taxes</li>
                <li style="text-align: left;">NHL by non-individual: 4% of principal of loan being prepaid + applicable taxes</li>
            </ul>
            <div th:if="${isMortgageForeclosureChangesApplicable == true}">
                <ul>
                    <li>Loans availed by Individual Borrower and / or Micro &amp; Small Enterprises (MSEs) at Floating Rate of Interest: <b>No prepayment or part-payment charges. (Housing Loans &amp; Non-Housing Loans)</b></li>
                    <li>Loans availed by Non-Individuals (Other than MSEs) at Floating Rate of Interest: <b>4% of the principal amount being prepaid, plus applicable taxes. (Housing Loans &amp; Non-Housing Loans)</b></li>
                    <li>Loans availed by Individuals at Fixed Rate of Interest: <b>2% of the principal amount being prepaid, plus applicable taxes. (Housing Loans)</b></li>
                    <li>Loans availed by Individuals at Fixed Rate of Interest: <b>4% of the principal amount being prepaid, plus applicable taxes. (Non-Housing Loans)</b></li>
                    <li>Loans availed by Non-Individuals at Fixed Rate of Interest: <b>4% of the principal amount being prepaid, plus applicable taxes. (Housing Loans &amp; Non-Housing Loans)</b></li>
                </ul>
                <div>
                    <b>Part-Payment Terms:</b> The borrower may make part-payments towards the outstanding principal only once in a calendar month. Each such part-payment amount should exceed one (1) Equated Monthly Instalment (EMI) else any amount less than or equal to one (1) EMI shall be treated as an advance EMI and shall not be considered as a part-payment towards reduction of the principal.
                </div>
            </div>
        </td>
        <td class="top_up_col" th:if="${top_up_applicable}" style="text-align: justify;">
            <ul th:if="${isMortgageForeclosureChangesApplicable}!=true">
                <li>Fixed rate HL: 2% of principal of loan being prepaid + applicable taxes</li>
                <li>NHL for business purpose (individual): 4% of principal of loan being prepaid + applicable taxes</li>
                <li>NHL by non-individual: 4% of principal of loan being prepaid + applicable taxes</li>
            </ul>
            <div th:if="${isMortgageForeclosureChangesApplicable == true}">
                <ul>
                    <li>Loans availed by Individual Borrower and / or Micro &amp; Small Enterprises (MSEs) at Floating Rate of Interest: <b>No prepayment or part-payment charges. (Housing Loans &amp; Non-Housing Loans)</b></li>
                    <li>Loans availed by Non-Individuals (Other than MSEs) at Floating Rate of Interest: <b>4% of the principal amount being prepaid, plus applicable taxes. (Housing Loans &amp; Non-Housing Loans)</b></li>
                    <li>Loans availed by Individuals at Fixed Rate of Interest: <b>2% of the principal amount being prepaid, plus applicable taxes. (Housing Loans)</b></li>
